C'est un projet de fans indépendant de P:
It is a fan project independent from Playnest, still in pre-release. Playnest downloads its kit from its official page; the kit then builds a PC version of the game from your own file, and keeps itself up to date.

You need:
• an NVIDIA RTX 20 or AMD RX 6000 graphics card, or newer;
• 16 GB of memory and about %1 GB free on the disk;
• 10 to 45 minutes for the first build, once;
• the same kit version for every player, and each player their own copy of the game.

Windows Defender may show a warning about the kit's scripts: the project describes it as a false alarm.
